{"unit_id":"SOH4C4759__dsh-plugin-restart#feature-1","repo":"SOH4C4759/dsh-plugin-restart","commit":"72e2e0a523544f4a2637cfb3640b4d31ed386802","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-restart 的功能「桌面应用重启」：客户端按钮向 Host 发起重启请求，Host 安排独立守护程序关闭并重新启动 DSH 桌面应用。用户可在确认面板中选择立即重启。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:48-51","index.js:1238-1256","lib/restart-supervisor.ps1:14-21"]}
{"unit_id":"SOH4C4759__dsh-plugin-restart#feature-2","repo":"SOH4C4759/dsh-plugin-restart","commit":"72e2e0a523544f4a2637cfb3640b4d31ed386802","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-restart 的功能「插件变更提示」：Host 监视已加载入口模块的变化并记录待重启状态，客户端可在最新一轮回复末尾呈现提示，提供稍后或立即重启操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1410-1422","client.js:703-720"]}
{"unit_id":"SOH4C4759__dsh-plugin-restart#feature-3","repo":"SOH4C4759/dsh-plugin-restart","commit":"72e2e0a523544f4a2637cfb3640b4d31ed386802","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-restart 的功能「按钮位置与提示设置」：插件详情设置页允许选择侧栏、会话标题栏、输入框工具行、输入框下方或隐藏按钮，并切换回复末尾提示。设置通过 Host 接口保存。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:807-896","index.js:1158-1170"]}
{"unit_id":"SOH4C4759__dsh-plugin-restart#feature-4","repo":"SOH4C4759/dsh-plugin-restart","commit":"72e2e0a523544f4a2637cfb3640b4d31ed386802","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-restart 的功能「托盘重启入口」：可选的 Windows 托盘宿主提供重启 DSH 的入口，也可在应用未运行时启动它；托盘还处理 Host 无法启动守护程序时写入的请求。","source":"generated","evidence":["tray/tray-host.ps1:6-20","tray/tray-host.ps1:26-39"]}
